	"name": "Stewardship",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/defensive/shield-barrier-glowing-triangle-blue-yellow.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Protecting your companion is as important as defending yourself. As a 2nd level Sentinel, you gain the ability to sacrifice for your companion. Whenever your companion would gain a level of fatigue you gain the fatigue, instead.</p><p>In addition, you can use your reaction to protect your companion if they are attacked while within 5ft of you. In doing so, you step into the line of fire by swapping position with your companion. You use this ability before the attack is rolled. On a hit, you take half of the attack’s damage and your companion takes the other half.</p>",
